34:["$","p",null,{"className":"rv-panel-foot","children":["30"," closed nights to the left of tonight, ","31"," nights still on the books to the right. The reference series is the same night a year ago, already closed: past tonight it sets a finished year against a book that is still filling, which is why the gap widens on its own. Nothing to the right of tonight is a projection."]}]
39:["$","p",null,{"className":"rv-panel-foot","children":"Drawn as a share and not in euros on purpose: in euros the shape is dominated by how full each night is, and the change in mix — which is the question — disappears underneath it. The volume is already told by the revenue series above. The same window and the same observation moment as that series, so the two charts always talk about the same nights."}]
